{"id":"msg_m_ex_neonvisioneye_01","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_neon","label":"Neon · Nikke"},"label":"8. Master,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_event_liarsend_01_03","next":"msg_m_ex_neonvisioneye_02","speakers":{"neon_v":"Neon"},"icons":{"neon_v":"si_c018_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_1","text":"Master,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_2","text":"what am I supposed to do with this empty feeling?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_3","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_4","text":"It's like an elder lady","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_5","text":"who has to say goodbye","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_6","text":"to her lifelong partner...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_7","text":"What happened?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_8","text":"Now that my glasses","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_9","text":"don't glint anymore,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_10","text":"I feel weirdly empty.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_11","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_11","text":"Is it really that big a deal that it's not glinting?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_12","text":"Of course!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_13","text":"Do you know how important that is?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_14","text":"The moment light glints off my glasses,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_15","text":"it's like I've just had a breakthrough","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_16","text":"and solved every mystery!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_17","text":"And it makes me look insanely smart.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_18","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_19","text":"I used to be able to look down at people,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_20","text":"go \"heh heh,\"","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_21","text":"and come off like some kind of mastermind.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_22","text":"But now?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_23","text":"I can't even do that anymore.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_24","text":"So yeah, a lot of what made me me is kind of gone.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_25","text":"Even my intellectual image took a hit.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_26","text":"Don't you think one trait's enough?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_27","text":"Ah!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_28","text":"I see now!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_29","text":"I get what you mean, Master.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_30","text":"I wasn't thinking straight.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_31","text":"You're saying I shouldn't spread myself too thin.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_32","text":"Instead, I should pick one thing and really commit to it, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_33","text":"Can you see it now?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_34","text":"Hehe, yeah!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_35","text":"Neon means firepower, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_36","text":"So Neo-Neon has to mean Neo-Firepower!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_37","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_37","text":"Glad you're feeling a little better.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_38","text":"Thank you, Master!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_39","text":"I almost lost sight of who I am.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_40","text":"Just because my surroundings changed","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_41","text":"doesn't mean my core has.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_42","text":"I, your humble student,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_43","text":"will get my head back in the game!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_44","text":"And I'll be sure to enjoy my firepower to the fullest!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_45","text":"Yeah, you got this.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_46","text":"Yes!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_neonvisioneye_01_47","text":"I'll get my head straight and report back!","jump":null}],"chat":true}